      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutmera, ayenyo gi cunyan je ni ji paran je jowobothi! Neni paka akwayo Were rijo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole anyalo ridho ni cuny jo omaro Were, to maro pajo kicungi kwoŋ niaŋ m'otire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fodi jok'oniaŋ royo ma Were keth'iye gi go ji i tiro gine, aka wegi jotieko temo cwogo royo pajo; am'omiyo jok'ojolo royo ma Were keth'iye gine ji i tiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Kristo am'obedo kama Cik gik'iye, ŋey nyaka dhano je ma yeyo wokethi i tiro gi Were.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Both obedo apa ji je",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 18:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ondiko kwoŋ wac ma bedo i tiro gi Were i winjo Cik ni, “Ŋata timo gima Cik waco, bino kwo gi Cik.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.30.12+DEU.30.13+DEU.30.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 30:12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To me a gima ndiko waco kwoŋ ketho dhano i tiro gi Were ro yeyo: “Ikir'iwaci i cunyin ni, ‘Ŋat'oidhi i polo?’ ” (Dwoŋ mere ni dwoko Kristo i piny ka). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kosa ni, ‘Ŋat'olori piny i bur maluth?’ ” (Dwoŋ mere ni kidho cerino Kristo kwoŋ jom'otho.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a gima Ndiko waco: “Kole wac nitie cegin kodin, i dhokin kodi i cunyin.” (Dwoŋ mere ni wac ma yeyo ma wafonjo.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rupiri k'ituco gi dhokin ni, “Yesu meno Rwoth.” Aka iyeyo i cunyin nike Were ocerino go kwoŋ jom'otho, ibino both. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato dhano yeyo gi i cunye to ikwanyo woko banja kwoŋe; aka tuco gi dhoke to limo both. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 28:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ndiko waco ni, “Moro je ma yeyo go k'onwaŋ wickwot.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me mako kwoŋ dhano je, rupiri pokirok ongoye i dier Joyuda kodi Jopath; Were acel am'obedo Rwoth pa ji je, aka go miyo dhano je ma lwoŋo go silwany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yowel 3:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ndiko waco ni, “Nyatoro je m'olwoŋ nyingi Rwoth bino both”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jolwoŋ nedi ŋata fodi jok'oyeyo kwoŋe? Odoko joyey nedi ŋata fodi jok'owinjo wac ma mako kwoŋe? Odoko jowinji nedi m'ongoye ŋat'otito rijo mikwenda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.52.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 52:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jotiti nedi mikwenda, ka k'oor jo? Kole ondiki ni, “Bino pa joma kelo Wac Manyen Maber obedo gimaber ma nedi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 53:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ki Joisiraili je ma jojolo Wac Manyen Maber. Isaya won owaco ni, “Rwoth, ŋat'oyeyo mikwenda mawan?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo yeyo wok i winjo mikwenda, aka mikwenda wok i fonji kwoŋ Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
